B.aLV=new A.E(null,"RL.11-12.6",B.p,"11-12","RL","Analyze a case in which grasping a point of view requires distinguishing what is directly stated in a text from what is really meant (e.g., satire, sarcasm, irony, or understatement).",!1)
B.aM_=new A.E(null,"RL.11-12.7",B.p,"11-12","RL","Analyze multiple interpretations of a story, drama, or poem (e.g., recorded or live production of a play or recorded novel or poetry), evaluating how each version interprets the source text. (Include at least one play by Shakespeare and one play by an American dramatist.)",!1)
